WEBVTT

00:00:04.110 --> 00:00:05.510
Violin?

00:00:08.690 --> 00:00:11.120
Violin, where are you?

00:00:21.230 --> 00:00:23.230
<i>Say goodbye, hello</i>

00:00:23.230 --> 00:00:28.470
<i>Then we repeat, going</i>
<i>eternally round and round</i>

00:00:28.470 --> 00:00:36.010
<i>Where will our path lead?</i>

00:00:36.010 --> 00:00:42.520
<i>What do I lose sight of when I'm with you?</i>

00:00:42.520 --> 00:00:50.190
<i>A colorful array of love and kindness</i>

00:00:50.190 --> 00:00:56.900
<i>I've remembered what</i>
<i>I'd forgotten since the days</i>

00:00:56.900 --> 00:01:03.170
<i>when we hurt each other over trivial things</i>

00:01:03.170 --> 00:01:10.450
<i>The sounds of our footsteps are</i>
<i>the "tracks" that lead to the future</i>

00:01:10.450 --> 00:01:18.190
<i>Within the ever-changing scenery... always</i>

00:01:18.190 --> 00:01:20.220
<i>Say goodbye, hello</i>

00:01:20.220 --> 00:01:25.290
<i>Then we repeat, going</i>
<i>eternally round and round</i>

00:01:25.290 --> 00:01:32.370
<i>This melody that paints the future,</i>
<i>until the world changes</i>

00:01:32.370 --> 00:01:34.370
<i>Say goodbye, hello</i>

00:01:34.370 --> 00:01:39.610
<i>The sun always rises again,</i>
<i>eternally repeating its arc</i>

00:01:39.610 --> 00:01:50.450
<i>It lights up our path</i>

00:02:04.430 --> 00:02:08.140
This Entangler launches a fluctuation
in existence probabilities.

00:02:08.140 --> 00:02:10.440
"Fluctuation"? What does that mean?

00:02:10.440 --> 00:02:12.430
Shut up and watch.

00:02:26.490 --> 00:02:27.820
Impressive.

00:02:27.820 --> 00:02:32.200
At maximum output, you can
destroy three times that area.

00:02:32.200 --> 00:02:35.430
Isn't that overkill to use on one person?

00:02:36.500 --> 00:02:40.000
A strategy can only be formed
when you create an overwhelming gap

00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:42.640
in military power.

00:02:42.640 --> 00:02:46.380
I won't hold back, even if
my opponent is a lone lxioran.

00:02:46.380 --> 00:02:49.780
Was it really the Federation
investigator who did this?

00:02:49.780 --> 00:02:50.880
What?

00:02:50.880 --> 00:02:54.220
Why would an investigator need to kill us?

00:02:54.220 --> 00:02:57.620
Isn't it their mission to arrest us?

00:02:57.620 --> 00:02:59.190
I don't think she's the one who...

00:02:59.190 --> 00:03:01.860
It's probably to silence us.

00:03:01.860 --> 00:03:04.190
Someone's betrayed us to
protect their own interests.

00:03:04.190 --> 00:03:09.390
Plus, who else would find out
about us and attack us? No one.

00:03:11.870 --> 00:03:15.370
The question is, how do we lure her out?

00:03:15.370 --> 00:03:18.200
I have a good idea.

00:03:32.890 --> 00:03:34.990
Shinmyou!

00:03:34.990 --> 00:03:37.530
Sorry to trouble you, Dr. Shimada.

00:03:37.530 --> 00:03:39.360
Here you go.

00:03:41.030 --> 00:03:44.230
How long do you intend to fake it with this medicine?

00:03:44.230 --> 00:03:46.900
I have a senior who specializes in this type of thing.

00:03:46.900 --> 00:03:49.040
Get yourself properly checked out.

00:03:49.040 --> 00:03:51.110
If you've got a brain tumor...

00:03:51.110 --> 00:03:54.740
I couldn't trust a senior of yours.

00:03:54.740 --> 00:03:58.080
Just kidding. This medicine is enough.

00:03:58.080 --> 00:04:00.910
There aren't any stronger painkillers, you know!

00:04:05.520 --> 00:04:09.460
I heard about your dad from Nami...

00:04:09.460 --> 00:04:13.730
What am I going to do with those gossipy nurses?

00:04:13.730 --> 00:04:16.900
Why didn't you tell me?

00:04:16.900 --> 00:04:21.540
I didn't want you to worry about me.

00:04:21.540 --> 00:04:23.940
It's okay if you cry.

00:04:23.940 --> 00:04:25.640
You can cry, Nataru!

00:04:25.640 --> 00:04:27.040
Huh?

00:04:27.040 --> 00:04:29.240
I'll comfort you!

00:04:32.210 --> 00:04:35.950
You read another trashy manga, didn't you?

00:04:35.950 --> 00:04:37.940
I was being serious!

00:04:40.120 --> 00:04:44.390
I understand what it's like to be left alone, too.

00:04:44.390 --> 00:04:47.990
But... I had you here for me.

00:04:55.810 --> 00:04:58.170
Tickle, tickle, tickle!

00:04:58.170 --> 00:05:00.610
Sheesh! That's sexual harassment!

00:05:04.080 --> 00:05:07.320
Hey, will you stay with me forever?

00:05:07.320 --> 00:05:11.650
An older guy like me hanging around
forever would just be annoying.

00:05:11.650 --> 00:05:13.490
You won't?

00:05:16.290 --> 00:05:22.130
I'm sure someone will show up that you
want to be around way more than me.

00:05:22.130 --> 00:05:25.170
If you decide right now, you'll regret it.

00:05:25.170 --> 00:05:27.840
Is this because of that woman?

00:05:27.840 --> 00:05:29.140
"That woman"?

00:05:29.140 --> 00:05:31.370
Shion! Shion Arita!

00:05:31.370 --> 00:05:35.310
You'd rather be with her than
with someone like me, right?

00:05:35.310 --> 00:05:37.310
You're perceptive, Shoko.

00:05:37.310 --> 00:05:40.650
S-So you... really do love her?

00:05:40.650 --> 00:05:43.050
It's unrequited.

00:05:43.050 --> 00:05:46.560
Just kidding! She's just a friend.

00:05:46.560 --> 00:05:47.990
Really?

00:05:47.990 --> 00:05:51.030
And we hardly ever even see each other.

00:05:51.030 --> 00:05:53.220
We're both busy, after all.

00:05:57.030 --> 00:05:59.370
Hello, Irma Agency!

00:05:59.370 --> 00:06:03.210
I'm very sorry, but the chairman is out right now...

00:06:03.210 --> 00:06:08.840
Yes, I'll tell her to call you right
away when she gets back! Goodbye!

00:06:10.310 --> 00:06:12.880
Why are we so busy today of all days?

00:06:12.880 --> 00:06:15.580
Hurry up and come back, Chairman!

00:06:15.580 --> 00:06:18.580
Hello, this is Irma's!

00:06:19.160 --> 00:06:22.490
Say, why don't we try again later? Irma's not here.

00:06:22.490 --> 00:06:24.430
I want information.

00:06:24.430 --> 00:06:26.060
No matter how trivial it may be...

00:06:26.060 --> 00:06:28.900
I understand how you feel, but...

00:06:31.270 --> 00:06:32.100
"Irma"

00:06:33.200 --> 00:06:35.040
Hello? Irma

00:06:35.040 --> 00:06:37.740
Is this the Federation investigator?

00:06:37.740 --> 00:06:41.340
I've got the old lady from the Altan network.

00:06:41.340 --> 00:06:42.780
What?

00:06:42.780 --> 00:06:44.770
Hold on a sec.

00:06:45.850 --> 00:06:49.090
Birdy, be careful! These guys are...

00:06:49.090 --> 00:06:54.520
If you want her back, come
alone to the Roppongi ruins.

00:06:58.260 --> 00:07:01.230
These are jailbreakers we're
talking about. It's got to be a trap!

00:07:01.230 --> 00:07:02.530
Probably so.

00:07:02.530 --> 00:07:03.730
Then...

00:07:03.730 --> 00:07:05.770
They must have killed Dusk.

00:07:05.770 --> 00:07:06.770
What?

00:07:06.770 --> 00:07:08.760
I'll never forgive them.

00:07:13.580 --> 00:07:16.910
Birdy, you shouldn't risk this!

00:07:16.910 --> 00:07:18.050
Birdy!

00:07:18.050 --> 00:07:20.240
Please, be quiet for a while!

00:07:42.240 --> 00:07:44.070
Pin the target in place.

00:07:50.310 --> 00:07:52.280
Irma!

00:07:52.280 --> 00:07:54.620
Whoa, there. Don't move.

00:07:54.620 --> 00:07:56.320
Valic Nigua.

00:07:56.320 --> 00:07:57.920
Don't come any closer.

00:07:57.920 --> 00:08:00.760
Don't add to the crimes you've already committed!

00:08:00.760 --> 00:08:02.960
Well, you sure sound like a cop.

00:08:02.960 --> 00:08:06.960
Did you get Faroid to let his guard
down like that before you killed him?

00:08:06.960 --> 00:08:08.930
Faroid was killed too?

00:08:08.930 --> 00:08:10.670
Don't bother with the phony act.

00:08:10.670 --> 00:08:13.100
We know you did it.

00:08:14.200 --> 00:08:20.110
We know from the data we received
that all three were tortured to death.

00:08:20.110 --> 00:08:21.980
Who ordered you to do it?

00:08:21.980 --> 00:08:23.710
Do what?

00:08:23.710 --> 00:08:27.520
You were ordered to kill
us to keep us quiet, right?

00:08:27.520 --> 00:08:32.050
Not a bad idea, getting an
lxioran investigator to do it.

00:08:32.050 --> 00:08:34.680
It's just the sort of job for you.

00:08:36.230 --> 00:08:40.460
You're an lxioran created for use
by the Federation government.

00:08:40.460 --> 00:08:44.730
You guys made with the dominant
genes of Altans aren't people!

00:08:44.730 --> 00:08:46.870
You're monsters!

00:08:46.870 --> 00:08:48.670
"Made"?

00:08:48.670 --> 00:08:52.470
The Powers That Be who made
you lxioran monsters are all scum!

00:08:52.470 --> 00:08:57.310
They can all just die!

00:08:57.310 --> 00:09:00.520
Even if innocent people
have to die for that to happen?

00:09:00.520 --> 00:09:05.250
They're not innocent! They've been
making fools of the Altans all this time!

00:09:05.250 --> 00:09:09.760
Who cares how many of those jerks die?

00:09:09.760 --> 00:09:14.600
This world that disrespected
us Altans can just perish!

00:09:14.600 --> 00:09:17.100
That's not true!

00:09:17.100 --> 00:09:21.670
Hey, I told you not to move!
Don't you care if the old lady dies?

00:09:21.670 --> 00:09:23.660
Just do it, then.

00:09:25.270 --> 00:09:30.550
You're an Isdaltan who killed all
those people in the Central Tower hit.

00:09:30.550 --> 00:09:33.080
Kill her, just like you killed Dusk!

00:09:33.080 --> 00:09:35.280
Wait, don't move! Stop right there!

00:09:52.470 --> 00:09:54.300
Did we get her?

00:09:56.370 --> 00:09:58.370
Valic...

00:09:58.370 --> 00:09:59.570
Dammit!

00:10:00.640 --> 00:10:01.870
Hold it!

00:10:06.780 --> 00:10:08.610
You're in my way!

00:10:11.420 --> 00:10:13.050
Where's Valic?

00:10:15.460 --> 00:10:16.650
Valic...

00:10:20.830 --> 00:10:21.820
Huh?

00:10:34.740 --> 00:10:37.140
I came to pick you up.

00:10:39.780 --> 00:10:43.190
I guess you're useful sometimes.

00:10:43.190 --> 00:10:45.620
Give me a raise, please.

00:11:13.050 --> 00:11:14.480
Die!

00:11:20.290 --> 00:11:21.280
Withdraw.

00:11:22.690 --> 00:11:26.060
You're at a disadvantage in
hand-to-hand combat with an lxioran.

00:11:26.060 --> 00:11:28.500
- But...
- Just withdraw, now.

00:11:35.540 --> 00:11:37.530
Lailalo, the gate.

00:12:07.870 --> 00:12:11.870
Come on, if you don't hurry,
you'll be late for school.

00:12:11.870 --> 00:12:13.270
Oh, crap!

00:12:27.520 --> 00:12:29.630
Crap, I'm going to be late!

00:12:29.630 --> 00:12:31.560
Senkawa!

00:12:31.560 --> 00:12:34.300
Hurry up! Come on!

00:12:34.300 --> 00:12:35.290
Hayamiya...

00:12:40.240 --> 00:12:41.220
Look.

00:12:51.050 --> 00:12:54.650
That's enough, isn't it? Let's go home.

00:12:54.650 --> 00:12:55.640
Okay.

00:13:04.160 --> 00:13:06.150
Hey, buy me some ice cream.

00:13:17.070 --> 00:13:20.240
A dream?

00:13:20.240 --> 00:13:22.010
Huh?

00:13:22.010 --> 00:13:24.110
What am I doing in Birdy's...

00:13:24.110 --> 00:13:26.650
- spaceship?

00:13:26.650 --> 00:13:30.320
Captain Megius, Birdy Cephon
has regained consciousness.

00:13:30.320 --> 00:13:31.920
Birdy?

00:13:31.920 --> 00:13:34.160
That was a close call, Birdy.

00:13:34.160 --> 00:13:37.090
It looks like you were shot
with an entanglement bullet.

00:13:37.090 --> 00:13:41.530
It was seriously dicey!
It's partly Birdy's fault, you know.

00:13:41.530 --> 00:13:44.100
She just rushed in without thinking.

00:13:44.100 --> 00:13:45.370
Er, Birdy?

00:13:45.370 --> 00:13:48.970
Oh, now that you mention it,
Birdy won't answer me.

00:13:48.970 --> 00:13:51.210
She must still be asleep.

00:13:51.210 --> 00:13:52.440
Birdy!

00:13:52.440 --> 00:13:54.380
I'm telling you, Birdy is...

00:13:54.380 --> 00:13:56.040
- You...
- Yes?

00:13:56.040 --> 00:13:57.780
Who are you?!

00:13:57.780 --> 00:14:02.280
Oh, come on! It's me! Tsutomu Senkawa.

00:14:02.280 --> 00:14:04.890
What?

00:14:04.890 --> 00:14:06.290
Huh?

00:14:06.290 --> 00:14:07.490
Huh?!

00:14:07.490 --> 00:14:11.290
Wh-Why?!

00:14:11.290 --> 00:14:15.960
H-Hey, Birdy, hurry up and change into my body!

00:14:15.960 --> 00:14:17.560
Birdy!

00:14:18.670 --> 00:14:21.740
You really are Tsutomu Senkawa, then?

00:14:21.740 --> 00:14:23.970
What do you suppose this means?

00:14:23.970 --> 00:14:27.010
This is Birdy's body, but I
can feel things through it.

00:14:27.010 --> 00:14:29.240
It's just like when it's my body!

00:14:29.240 --> 00:14:33.680
Oh, even my voice is Birdy's!

00:14:33.680 --> 00:14:35.520
Wake up, Birdy!

00:14:35.520 --> 00:14:37.650
It can't be...

00:14:37.650 --> 00:14:42.020
Hey! Birdy! Come on, wake up!

00:14:42.020 --> 00:14:43.420
Hey!

00:14:44.660 --> 00:14:45.090
"Journalism Club"

00:14:45.090 --> 00:14:47.230
That darn Senkawa...

00:14:47.230 --> 00:14:51.220
I can't believe he'd skip school
when we're so busy. He's useless!

00:14:59.580 --> 00:15:02.950
Sheesh, honestly...

00:15:02.950 --> 00:15:06.550
Hey, you! Quit slacking off and work!

00:15:06.550 --> 00:15:08.020
We're not slacking off!

00:15:08.020 --> 00:15:10.450
We're researching the Roppongi ruins.

00:15:10.450 --> 00:15:13.190
A building collapsed because
of an unexplained explosion!

00:15:13.190 --> 00:15:14.960
An alien did it!

00:15:14.960 --> 00:15:16.790
Whatever, just do your jobs!

00:15:20.730 --> 00:15:23.530
All the stuff about the Roppongi ruins is like this?

00:15:23.530 --> 00:15:23.930
"Space Alien Base! Roppongi Ruins"
All the stuff about the Roppongi ruins is like this?

00:15:23.930 --> 00:15:25.360
"Space Alien Base! Roppongi Ruins"

00:15:40.050 --> 00:15:41.880
Shion Arita...

00:15:57.500 --> 00:16:01.940
Anyway, I'll contact a specialist,
so do your best until I get him.

00:16:06.440 --> 00:16:08.640
Do my best at <i>what?</i>

00:16:13.620 --> 00:16:14.680
Hello?

00:16:14.680 --> 00:16:16.290
Miss Arita, it's Capella.

00:16:16.290 --> 00:16:18.590
Huh? Um... er...

00:16:18.590 --> 00:16:21.580
We have your schedule for this week,
so please come pick it up.

00:16:23.960 --> 00:16:25.930
Schedule?

00:16:25.930 --> 00:16:27.760
For Shion Arita?

00:16:31.800 --> 00:16:35.670
This isn't funny! What...

00:16:35.670 --> 00:16:37.660
What should I do?!

00:16:40.310 --> 00:16:43.140
Aw, this is such a pain!

00:16:44.650 --> 00:16:47.050
I guess I have to change clothes, huh...

00:17:08.040 --> 00:17:10.660
What the heck am I doing?!

00:17:11.970 --> 00:17:16.480
That's not funny. You can't cancel your gigs.

00:17:16.480 --> 00:17:19.720
B-But there are some circumstances...

00:17:19.720 --> 00:17:21.380
Circumstances, eh?

00:17:21.380 --> 00:17:28.220
I almost got killed because I got
mixed up in your "circumstances."

00:17:28.220 --> 00:17:31.220
Miss Arita, please actually look at your schedule.

00:17:44.740 --> 00:17:47.940
Thank you, Sir...

00:17:47.940 --> 00:17:50.680
I'm cheering for you. Keep up the good work!

00:17:50.680 --> 00:17:54.080
Please continue your support, yessiree!

00:17:58.620 --> 00:18:04.260
Hey! Birdy! It's an autograph session. Wake up!

00:18:04.260 --> 00:18:05.260
No good, huh...

00:18:05.260 --> 00:18:07.460
Nice to meet you!

00:18:07.460 --> 00:18:08.690
Oh, right!

00:18:11.870 --> 00:18:14.440
<i>Give me a break...</i>

00:18:14.440 --> 00:18:18.310
I've been a fan since you debuted, Shiorin!

00:18:18.310 --> 00:18:19.740
Me too!

00:18:20.810 --> 00:18:22.800
Please shake my hand!

00:18:27.080 --> 00:18:29.920
I can die happy now!

00:18:29.920 --> 00:18:31.920
Please sign my t-shirt!

00:18:31.920 --> 00:18:33.750
O-Okay, Sir...

00:18:35.890 --> 00:18:37.720
<i>Ugh, gross!</i>

00:18:39.930 --> 00:18:42.630
Shiorin's real, live signature!

00:18:42.630 --> 00:18:45.330
Th-Thank you, Sir.

00:18:45.330 --> 00:18:47.570
Um, could I get a photo?

00:18:47.570 --> 00:18:49.640
Oh, sure.

00:18:49.640 --> 00:18:52.170
Please make a heart with me.

00:18:52.170 --> 00:18:54.680
H-Heart?

00:18:54.680 --> 00:18:56.810
Okay, here goes!

00:18:56.810 --> 00:18:58.440
Say cheese!

00:19:00.350 --> 00:19:02.180
<i>I want to die.</i>

00:19:08.960 --> 00:19:11.930
Shion baby, aren't you feeling well?

00:19:11.930 --> 00:19:14.330
I'm sorry.

00:19:14.330 --> 00:19:16.530
Okay, let's try changing up the mood.

00:19:16.530 --> 00:19:18.520
Costuming, next please!

00:19:19.200 --> 00:19:23.340
Okay, Shiorin, greet me with nice, moist eyes.

00:19:23.340 --> 00:19:27.610
W-Welcome home, Master.

00:19:27.610 --> 00:19:31.110
Give me an attacking posture,
like you're going to devour the men!

00:19:31.110 --> 00:19:35.050
l-I'll rip out your entrails, yessiree?

00:19:35.050 --> 00:19:38.190
Now with lips that'll
remind 'em of fully-ripened fruit!

00:19:38.190 --> 00:19:40.180
Yessiree, I'm in season!

00:19:41.520 --> 00:19:45.520
Okay, give me a Madonna smile,
like you're embracing all the men of the world!

00:19:48.900 --> 00:19:50.890
"Shion Arita"

00:19:52.700 --> 00:19:57.470
Okay, Shion, down the hatch! Go for it!

00:19:57.470 --> 00:20:01.470
Shion! Shion! Shion! Shion!

00:20:04.980 --> 00:20:08.180
l-I'll do my best, Sir...

00:20:19.190 --> 00:20:21.260
No more! I can't take it!

00:20:21.260 --> 00:20:23.400
I ended up eating <i>bugs!</i>

00:20:23.400 --> 00:20:25.070
Can you imagine that?!

00:20:25.070 --> 00:20:28.770
If you did that, Captain, it'd be <i>cannibalism!</i>

00:20:28.770 --> 00:20:31.540
Well? How about answering me?!

00:20:31.540 --> 00:20:35.540
I was able to contact the specialist.

00:20:35.540 --> 00:20:38.510
This is Dr. Dohlay.

00:20:38.510 --> 00:20:42.880
Um, can l... I mean, can Birdy be treated?

00:20:42.880 --> 00:20:45.950
I analyzed her test results from the Lailalo,

00:20:45.950 --> 00:20:50.230
and it seems the "light" that
grazed her head was a special bullet.

00:20:50.230 --> 00:20:53.960
She has almost no external injuries,
but I see abnormal brain activity.

00:20:53.960 --> 00:20:56.460
Tsutomu Senkawa, I'd like to confirm one thing.

00:20:56.460 --> 00:20:57.930
Y-Yes?

00:20:57.930 --> 00:21:01.740
You say you had a strange
dream after Birdy collapsed.

00:21:01.740 --> 00:21:05.730
Is this the woman who appeared in that dream?

00:21:07.410 --> 00:21:11.780
I am a type Rauna I. My individual name is "Violin."

00:21:11.780 --> 00:21:15.880
l-It was her! I'm sure of it!

00:21:15.880 --> 00:21:18.920
This is not a good sign.

00:21:18.920 --> 00:21:22.590
What is it? Tell me, too!

00:21:22.590 --> 00:21:25.560
It looks like you've begun to undergo mental fusion.

00:21:25.560 --> 00:21:28.100
Mental fusion?

00:21:28.100 --> 00:21:31.900
If this goes on, it's likely both
your memories will remain jumbled

00:21:31.900 --> 00:21:36.440
and Birdy's personality will be
steadily overwritten by yours,

00:21:36.440 --> 00:21:39.640
eventually being totally erased.

00:21:41.280 --> 00:21:46.110
<i>Only a love that's ended becomes a seed</i>

00:21:46.110 --> 00:21:52.310
<i>Next, a flower blooms</i>

00:22:03.870 --> 00:22:09.370
<i>If you hang your head like that,</i>
<i>you won't get any sunlight</i>

00:22:09.370 --> 00:22:14.940
<i>Look up at the blue sky so you'll grow taller!</i>

00:22:14.940 --> 00:22:20.620
<i>Let's pour a few tears from the watering can</i>

00:22:20.620 --> 00:22:26.610
<i>Eventually shoots will spring up</i>
<i>from somewhere in your heart</i>

00:22:29.220 --> 00:22:32.330
<i>Let's take life slowly</i>

00:22:32.330 --> 00:22:37.330
<i>A girl's dreams are neverending</i>

00:22:37.330 --> 00:22:43.540
<i>Ah, there's someone</i>
<i>out there waiting for you</i>

00:22:43.540 --> 00:22:48.380
<i>Only a love that's ended becomes a seed</i>

00:22:48.380 --> 00:22:55.050
<i>Next, a flower blooms</i>

00:22:55.050 --> 00:22:59.850
<i>Only a love that's ended becomes a seed</i>

00:22:59.850 --> 00:23:05.850
<i>Next, a flower blooms</i>

00:23:11.270 --> 00:23:14.040
<i>This is Birdy Cephon Altira!</i>

00:23:14.040 --> 00:23:20.110
<i>The adult me is being mentally fused</i>
<i>after an attack by the escapees.</i>

00:23:20.110 --> 00:23:21.610
<i>The doctor, Dr. Dohlay,</i>

00:23:21.610 --> 00:23:27.220
<i>sends Tsutomu into my memories</i>
<i>to get me back to normal.</i>

00:23:27.220 --> 00:23:31.850
<i>So, Tsutomu will see my childhood world.</i>

00:23:31.850 --> 00:23:35.890
<i>And inside that memory world...</i>

00:23:35.890 --> 00:23:38.880
<i>Violin, will I be able to get back safe?</i>
